WEBVTT

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.350
Kana, lately you've been eating really well.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:12.150
Yes, I keep getting hungry,
no matter how much I eat.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:13.500
I see...

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:16.070
Thanks for the food.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:18.040
You're done already?

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:18.860
Yes.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.530
What's wrong? Is your stomach not okay?

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:25.080
No, it's nothing.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:27.140
Could it be...

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:29.260
You have me, and yet...

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.190
Please give it to me straight,

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:34.360
whose child are you carrying?!

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.030
Well it's certainly not yours.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:43.510
Oh, if you're not eating that, I'll have it!

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:48.250
Oh my,

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.540
let's get you changed right away.

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:54.870
Don't worry, I'm good at
taking clothes off. Ow!

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:58.640
Grandma, the summer didn't
drain my energy,

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:01.040
and the food's good today as well.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.970
It's fine that it was good, but...

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:41.400
My First Diet?

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:41.370
NOOOO!

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:49.670
I know, the scale just
needs to be adjusted.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:56.850
Ahaha, I bet it's the weight of my clothes.

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:59.780
EEEEEEK!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:02.550
It looks like it's serious.

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:04.650
I guess so.

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:07.510
What's wrong?

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:08.080
Huh?

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:10.340
You're kind of weird today.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:12.500
You didn't eat much,

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:17.440
and even when Kana screamed
"NOOOO" and "EEEEEK",

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:22.280
you didn't say, "Shut up! If you keep
screaming, you get a pay cut!".

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:23.900
Did something happen?

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:26.810
No, nothing happened...

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.210
What's wrong, Kana?

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:34.630
It's over, there's no hope...

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:40.310
Don't worry, Kana!

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:44.850
You just need to go on
a diet! I'll support you!

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:47.260
A diet?

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:50.420
Oh Chief, are you dieting as well?

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:54.490
Oh, that's what it was.

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:58.290
That's why you left so much of your dinner.

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:01.020
Um, I'm happy!

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:06.090
What?! You're saying you're
happy that I got fat?!

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:10.060
Er, no, it's... you know, camaraderie...

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.360
Don't lump me together with you!

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.450
But why? You haven't gained weight at all.

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:18.360
I won't be deceived by lies like that!

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:21.710
I mean lately all my clothes
have gotten tight.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:25.080
Oh, that's what it's about. That's...

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.230
What?

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:32.300
See, before you only went
up to my stomach,

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:34.510
but now you're here.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.210
What?

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:40.660
You've grown well.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:43.140
Haruka, I'm surprised you noticed.

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:46.340
Usually people don't notice
if they live together.

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:47.640
It's because I look at her.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:48.440
Huh?

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:53.150
Because I look at her e-v-e-r-y day.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:54.790
Whatever.

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:57.050
Um, Haruka-san.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:59.390
What about me?

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:03.150
I'm heavier than the time I weighed
myself at the bath...

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.750
That must mean that I've
gotten bigger, right?

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:10.820
Yes, you've definitely grown.

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:12.770
Really?!

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:16.230
You have, especially...

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:19.460
this area has gotten supple.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:20.340
Uh...

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:25.100
But this area hasn't changed at all.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:27.290
That means...

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:31.260
You've gained weight! But your
breasts haven't gotten bigger!

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:33.730
NOOOOO!

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:39.050
I'm going to go on a diet! I'm
going to endure it and diet!

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:41.980
What? But what about this?

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:45.110
Uh... Th-that's...

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:48.330
Kana, dieting is not good.

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:51.730
Chief, that's horrible. You
said you'd support me!

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:53.780
The situation has changed.

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:55.340
Hey...

00:05:55.340 --> 00:06:02.510
Kana-san, refusing to eat can cause
stress and make you rebound.

00:06:02.510 --> 00:06:07.430
How about trying to do a healthy diet?

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:09.080
Healthy?

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:10.140
That's right.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.730
Let's burn the fat by moving.

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:18.190
I've got a good idea, why don't
we start the diet tomorrow?

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.360
So, Kana-chan.

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.020
But...

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:28.860
Diet Diet Diet ... Starting Tomorrow

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:28.760
Well then, just today...

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:30.940
Thank you!

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:30.950
Just today.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:32.840
<b>And...</b>

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:44.760
This is something I used at another job.

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:49.520
You get really hot when wearing this.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:51.960
Could this be...

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:54.110
Yup, it's just right, huh?

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:58.410
Hinata-san, this isn't just right!

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:01.410
Look at how I'm sweating!

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:04.890
It's amazing! This is burning up the fat!

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:07.450
I found Mika-chan!

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:10.210
Hey, Mika-chan!

00:07:12.770 --> 00:07:14.670
Good morning!

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:23.920
Huh?

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:27.420
Oh yeah, she wouldn't recognize
me in this...

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:28.810
Expensive booze.

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:40.860
All right, I'm going to work
hard until the last house!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:48.030
I can't... I can't do this...

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:53.990
The mailbox is so far away.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:58.000
But I have to do my work.

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:12.020
Damn. I've gotten lost because
of that monster.

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:14.730
The next time I see that
thing I'm going to...

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:25.580
Oh, Mika-chan!

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.010
Mika-chan!

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:29.670
It's here!

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:34.590
Mika-chan, it's me!

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:38.710
Kana Nakamachi!

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:43.260
Kana...

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:46.750
Heya...

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:50.250
Oh, Kana it's you.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:53.830
Um, Mika-chan, can you help me?

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:55.470
Why do I have to?

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:59.300
Please! Please, help me!

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:02.570
God, Buddha, Mika-sama!

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:05.270
Well, if you're that desperate...

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:12.940
Oh, are you scared of dogs, too?

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:18.530
What? Don't be ridiculous!
Dogs are nothing!

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:31.040
All right, grab this.

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:33.360
Is there cheese in there?

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:39.550
I'm saved...

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:42.000
Why do I have end up like this?

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:49.930
I said I'm not scared!

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:52.000
I didn't say anything.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:52.630
Jon?

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:55.890
What's the matter?

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:57.760
Huh? Sacchan?

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:58.450
Kana!

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:01.250
And Kujiin-san!

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:07.760
Oh, Miura-san... this is your house!

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:13.050
Yup. So you guys deliver our papers.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:16.280
I just happened to pass by here.

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:17.670
I see.

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:22.020
Oh! I'm sorry to ask this of you,

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:25.010
but could you do me a favor?

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:40.140
Kana-chan, here it comes!

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:41.290
All right!

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:51.020
This feels good!

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:53.220
Being hosed down's great, isn't it?

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:57.040
It is! It's getting rid of my sweat and
cleaning the costume as well.

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:58.310
It's perfect!

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:00.100
Isn't it?

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:05.640
The water's awesome!

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:10.210
What, you started already?

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:16.230
I'm sorry, my hand slipped.

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:22.570
High pressure water jet!

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:26.820
Wee, this thing's awesome!

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:28.940
Me too, me too!

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:33.900
Five, four, three, two, one.

00:11:31.360 --> 00:11:35.240
Barrier, barrier, barriaaaaa!

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:39.660
There, wet underwear attack!

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:42.810
What's wrong?

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:45.890
Usually this is where Haruka-san...

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.630
Oh, don't worry about that.

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:57.170
Hinata-san, you're on top of it!

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:02.200
By the way, that costume
was pretty good, right?

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:05.910
Yes! I feel like I burned quite a bit!

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:08.580
Especially around here!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.360
That's good.

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:14.240
But why did that costume get so dirty?

00:12:14.240 --> 00:12:18.070
Huh? Oh, I was attacked by Jon.

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:19.270
Who's Jon?

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:21.370
My friend's dog.

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:24.860
Dog? I love puppies!

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:26.520
Really?

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:27.600
Yes!

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.390
Actually,

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:35.040
that friend has to go to a relative's
house all of the sudden,

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:37.100
so she asked me if I could take
care of the walking, feeding,

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:40.110
and all that dog stuff until the evening.

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:40.950
What?

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:43.490
Just feeding it isn't enough?

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:46.910
No, apparently the family smothers
the dog with love,

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:50.710
so they think that Jon won't be able
to handle being alone until evening.

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:53.020
What a weakling...

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:55.620
I'm surprised you took on such
an involved request.

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:58.910
Well, she's my friend, so...

00:12:59.370 --> 00:13:04.300
But I'm actually scared of dogs...

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.350
All right,

00:13:05.350 --> 00:13:08.500
then I'll help you take care of it!

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:10.290
Of course, Yuuki will too!

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:11.320
Yes.

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:15.890
Oh yeah, how about taking
it to Kitanomaru Park?

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:21.030
Playing with the puppy will
be good for your diet.

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:24.080
Oh! That's a good idea!

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:25.860
I forgot my dentist's appointment.

00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:30.780
Mika-chan!

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:32.090
You're late!

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:33.820
I'm sorry!

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:41.240
Sheesh, why do I have be dragged into this?

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:44.790
Well, if you become friendly with the dog,

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:48.120
I think you won't get scared when
you're delivering papers.

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:49.880
I guess that's...

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:52.580
What are you talking about?!

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:56.010
That's right, you're not scared of dogs.

00:13:56.010 --> 00:14:00.540
Exactly, I simply underwent...
some trauma involving dogs.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:04.280
What? Mika-chan, you had a
tiger and a horse as well?!

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:04.290
[Note: tora=Tiger, uma=Horse;
torauma=trauma]

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:08.280
What are you talking about? The
only pet we had was a dog!

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:12.000
Hey!

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:15.360
Come on!

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:18.790
Let's go, Mika-chan!

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:21.630
Sorry for the wait.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:28.350
It's all right, Jon just wants to play.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.540
Is that so?

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:32.650
Go!

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:38.620
Yume-san, help me!

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:42.410
I see, so this is how the costume got dirty.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:45.780
All right, let's play!

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:48.270
Please help me already!

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:59.390
Chief, where is everybody?!

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:02.600
They went to walk the dog
in Maru park up north.

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:04.560
What? Walk the dog?

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:08.460
Stop, that tickles!

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:11.990
Are you going?

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:13.620
Of course!

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:19.090
Ahh, the butter-drenched Kana-chan
is calling for me.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:21.530
Here we go!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.130
There!

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:43.960
That Kana left me alone...

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:50.410
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:52.670
Get off of me!

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:54.840
Jon wants you to play with him.

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:58.210
Idiot, how am I supposed
to do that like this?

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.750
Like this.

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:18.130
Jon just wants to be played
with and petted.

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:20.580
I know that much.

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:24.690
I see, he just wants to be petted.

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:26.970
Then I'll go as well...

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:28.470
Eeeek!

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:30.760
I'm still scared!

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:44.560
Oh you!

00:16:45.090 --> 00:16:45.980
Go!

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:06.590
Hey, this is yummy!

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:15.750
Mi-chan, it looks like Jon
wants you to have some.

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:20.260
Um, Jon, what about me?

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:29.780
I don't want any dog treats!

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:50.290
Jon!

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:03.190
All right, take care of the rest then.

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:04.260
Okay!

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:07.330
Kana, where are they going?

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:09.230
They're preparing for the evening issue.

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:11.070
The delivery is about to come.

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:13.040
<b>And...</b>

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:16.420
Ah, I'm tired.

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:20.570
I'm jealous that you've become
friends with Jon.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:25.400
Eep! I guess I'm still a bit scared...

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:31.440
I don't have the right to
be friends with dogs.

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:34.170
Huh? Why not?

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:16.490
Mika-chan?

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:19.430
What's wrong?

00:19:19.430 --> 00:19:22.500
Oh, it's nothing.

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:27.580
By the way, what is your dog doing now?

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:29.610
She got married.

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:31.540
What, married?

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:32.560
Yes.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:35.340
What kind of dog is the groom?

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:37.070
I don't know.

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:40.580
She went to a family I
don't know very well,

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:42.080
so I don't know.

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:43.640
I see...

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:48.920
I wonder if she's doing well...

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:57.680
It looks like Jon wants to play more.

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:01.330
Oh, you're just insatiable!

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:03.420
All right Jon, let's go!

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:13.740
Oh, they're back already.

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:23.340
Jon!

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.250
Did you behave?

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:38.340
Um, Mika-chan...

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:39.900
Hey Kana...

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:40.790
Yes?

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:43.710
Do you think she's being treated

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:45.970
like that in her new family as well?

00:20:49.150 --> 00:20:51.490
Yes, of course!

00:20:51.760 --> 00:20:52.840
I see.

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:57.010
All right, then it's fine!

00:21:09.860 --> 00:21:13.650
Ahhh, bliss!

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:15.910
Kana-chan, do you want another one?

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:16.820
Yes!

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:20.990
Are you sure, Kana? That'll be your third.

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.530
Hey.

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:24.170
Yes?

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:27.340
Lately you've been eating really well.

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:32.300
Yes, I keep getting hungry,
no matter how much I eat. Huh?

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:34.110
Déjà vu all over again?

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:43.380
Oh no! Grandma!

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:47.750
I've totally and utterly forgotten
about my diet!

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:50.200
NOOOOO!

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:51.590
<b>And...</b>

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:57.040
I already told you, I'm not suspicious!

00:21:54.140 --> 00:21:57.040
Katsudon

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:00.010
The battle will continue!

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:44.950
My First Feelings

00:23:30.820 --> 00:23:33.390
